# Environment variable template. Copy to .env if a variable below is needed.
# Never commit .env.
#
# Local development needs NO variables: it runs on the Firebase Emulator Suite
# with the demo project "demo-generations".
#
# Deployed builds need NO Firebase web config variables either: the app loads
# it at runtime from Firebase Hosting's /__/firebase/init.json.
#
# PRIVILEGED credentials are never stored in this file or in the repository.
# - Local deploys authenticate with `npx firebase login`.
# - CI deploys authenticate through GitHub Actions secrets
#   (Workload Identity Federation, no long-lived keys).
#
# Variables for the deploy and admin-bootstrap steps will be added here when
# those steps are implemented.
